WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.822
Wide pivots work best when the category list is stable.

00:00:03.822 --> 00:00:08.887
Suppose the report has January, February, and March columns.

00:00:08.887 --> 00:00:14.765
When April arrives, the S Q L must be changed if April also needs its own column.

00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:20.690
That tells us something important: the categories are part of the output schema.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:26.492
If categories change often, keeping the data in long form may be a better design.
